id: pm-aaxq4n
title: "GH-1349: Bun 1.3.5 merge installer accepts a transient launcher"
description: Published 2026.9.29 under bunx --bun 1.3.5 reports merge install success but strict health sees all five driver commands drifted. The launcher selection falls back to a temporary Bun path when PATH has only a different Bun version.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-29T14:58:58.446Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-29T16:43:50.805Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-29T16:17:17.248Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-29T16:17:17.248Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Packed CLI under Bun 1.3.5 installs a stable version-matched launcher; strict health passes after init and repeated merge install; a real Git merge executes the driver and preserves item/history integrity; mismatched or invalid runner hints fail safely
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: high
confidence: 85
resolution: "Merge installer resolves a durable Bun launcher from the package runner or absolute PATH, validates its runtime version, and refuses to publish a fence when none is safe; public error contracts and recurrence gate are updated."
expected_result: Packed Bun 1.3.5 installs stable merge drivers; repeated install and strict health pass; real branch merge preserves item and history; mismatched launcher inputs fail safely.
actual_result: "Focused linked test 5/5, full repository 9,433 passing with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, bounded mutation admission, and isolated final tarball Bun 1.3.5 npm/npx/bunx, strict health, real branch merge, reconciliation, and valid three-entry history all passed."
